{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/wishlistfollow.gif?t=1749456613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replicat</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder that bends the rules of memory matching. Build powerful decks, break conventions with game-altering items, and score high with wild strategies.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/Steam_Subtitle1.gif?t=1749456613\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Matching cards is just the beginning. Stack game-breaking effects that twist the way you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reveal extra cards, keep tiles flipped, match wild Jokers, and even force mismatched pairs to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While memory helps, strategy is king as your deck grows stronger and more unpredictable.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Match cards in ways you never thought possible.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect unique curios that rewrite the rules of the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Turn mistakes into opportunities with clever deckbuilding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/Steam_Subtitle2.gif?t=1749456613\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with different deck archetypes to forge powerful, rule-defying strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you focus on extra moves, passive reveals, turn manipulation, multipliers or pure chaos, every build offers a unique way to outwit the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/Steam_Scoring.gif?t=1749456613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udccf 5 card colors, each with distinct mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2e 90+ unique cards, from memory-twisting effects to reality-breaking Jokers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 80+ curios that redefine how you match and strategize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">      \ud83e\uddea 5 essence categories with 18 upgrade types to shape your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 Face 21 levels of escalating challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc51 Battle unique boss stages, each with its own game-changing modifiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc31 10 starter decks, each with unique set of difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce8 MORE TO COME!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/Steam_Subtitle3.gif?t=1749456613\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two runs are ever the same in <strong>Replicat</strong>. Every game is packed with randomized challenges, unique modifiers, and fresh opportunities to experiment with new strategies. As you play, earn experience to unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New cards to expand your deck-building options</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> New starting decks for varied playstyles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Higher difficulties for even greater challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/Steam_Gameplay.gif?t=1749456613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in Replicat\u2019s jazzy, funky world filled with adorable cat emotes, meowing sound effects, and vibrant visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re chasing high scores or crafting outrageous combos, Replicat keeps you coming back for more!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3509430?t=1749456613","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3509430?t=1749456613","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/78d505e6e4682f1bcf7e40cb796eb72a0cfdf338/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749456613","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/78d505e6e4682f1bcf7e40cb796eb72a0cfdf338/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749456613","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3706490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/wishlistfollow.gif?t=1749456613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replicat</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder that bends the rules of memory matching. Build powerful decks, break conventions with game-altering items, and score high with wild strategies.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/Steam_Subtitle1.gif?t=1749456613\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Matching cards is just the beginning. Stack game-breaking effects that twist the way you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reveal extra cards, keep tiles flipped, match wild Jokers, and even force mismatched pairs to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While memory helps, strategy is king as your deck grows stronger and more unpredictable.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Match cards in ways you never thought possible.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect unique curios that rewrite the rules of the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Turn mistakes into opportunities with clever deckbuilding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/Steam_Subtitle2.gif?t=1749456613\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with different deck archetypes to forge powerful, rule-defying strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you focus on extra moves, passive reveals, turn manipulation, multipliers or pure chaos, every build offers a unique way to outwit the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/Steam_Scoring.gif?t=1749456613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udccf 5 card colors, each with distinct mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2e 90+ unique cards, from memory-twisting effects to reality-breaking Jokers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 80+ curios that redefine how you match and strategize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">      \ud83e\uddea 5 essence categories with 18 upgrade types to shape your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 Face 21 levels of escalating challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc51 Battle unique boss stages, each with its own game-changing modifiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc31 10 starter decks, each with unique set of difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce8 MORE TO COME!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/Steam_Subtitle3.gif?t=1749456613\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two runs are ever the same in <strong>Replicat</strong>. Every game is packed with randomized challenges, unique modifiers, and fresh opportunities to experiment with new strategies. As you play, earn experience to unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New cards to expand your deck-building options</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> New starting decks for varied playstyles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Higher difficulties for even greater challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/extras/Steam_Gameplay.gif?t=1749456613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in Replicat\u2019s jazzy, funky world filled with adorable cat emotes, meowing sound effects, and vibrant visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re chasing high scores or crafting outrageous combos, Replicat keeps you coming back for more!</p>","developers":["Brainoid Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509430/header.jpg?t=1749456613","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB Video Memory, capable of OpenGL 2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116754,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.co